@mthuret no this is not what I'm trying to accomplish. Screenshot below is from the site.
![UI Screenshot](https://puu.sh/vVabc/01e279198a.png)
Here you can see a record and a subset of its corresponding filters. This particular record has a range in price, `minPrice` - `maxPrice` or `500,000` to `550,000`. The price range component on the right should be able to filter for that record. So if a user enters a range, `525,000` to `600,000` , or `400,000` to `525,000`, or `400,000` to `600,000`, or `510,000` to `525,000`, then this record should be returned as a result.
